<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Class 9 | SHIVORA</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #10243A;
    color: #F5F7FA;
}

header {
    padding: 22px 8%;
    background: #0B1929;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

.logo {
    color: #F28C28;
    font-size: 27px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.home {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
}

.heading {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 55px 20px 30px;
}

.heading h1 {
    color: #F28C28;
    font-size: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.heading p {
    font-size: 18px;
}

.subjects {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 30px 8% 70px;
}

.card {
    background: #F5F7FA;
    color: #10243A;
    padding: 35px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border-bottom: 5px solid #F28C28;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-7px);
}

.card h2 {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.card p {
    color: #555;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.card a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #10243A;
}

.status {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 15px;
    background: #2878B8;
    color: white;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
    background: #0B1929;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">🔱 SHIVORA</div>
    <a class="home" href="index.html">Home</a>
</header>

<section class="heading">
    <h1>CLASS 9</h1>
    <p>Choose Your Subject</p>
    <p>Learn. Practise. Grow.</p>
</section>

<section class="subjects">

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Mathematics</h2>
        <p>Learn concepts and practise questions.</p>
        <span class="status">Coming Soon</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Science</h2>
        <p>Explore Physics, Chemistry and Biology.</p>
        <span class="status">Coming Soon</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>English</h2>
        <p>Improve grammar and literature.</p>
        <span class="status">Coming Soon</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Hindi</h2>
        <p>Study language and literature.</p>
        <span class="status">Coming Soon</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Punjabi</h2>
        <p>Learn language and literature.</p>
        <span class="status">Coming Soon</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <a href="socialscience.html">
            <h2>Social Science</h2>
            <p>History, Geography, Civics and Economics.</p>
            <span class="status">Explore Subjects</span>
        </a>
    </div>

</section>

<footer>
    <p>SHIVORA – Awaken Your Knowledge. 🔱</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
